# This project does not currently read process environment variables or a
# .env file for configuration. It's included here as a placeholder for
# convention's sake, and because it's the natural place to add a future
# secret if this project ever needs one (a broker API token, a
# notification webhook, etc.).
#
# The one secret this project actually has today -- the MT5 account
# login -- lives in scripts/local_settings.py instead (gitignored; copy
# scripts/local_settings.example.py to create it). See REBUILD.md
# section 5 for the full explanation.
